{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1f23c9d08e4925ec3c968b64b079b00ee92fd9e126db4ee09c72877abd458ac5", "ja": "みらいのおともだちへ！", "zh": "给未来的小伙伴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a1f189400c6f92c6a394ba1c7770d40e2e2f11eee3fffe24b2585445156f4149", "ja": "いよいよこの番組の目玉コーナー！　打ち上\nげ予定のロケットに、番組で考えたメッセー\nジプレートを乗せるとのこと。本当に宇宙人\nに届いちゃうかも？　みんなでたくさん考え\nた後は、歌のコーナーで『せんのー』開始！", "zh": "终于到了本节目的重头戏环节！据说会在即\n将发射的火箭上，装上节目里构思出的信息\n牌。说不定真的能传达到外星人那里？大家\n一起集思广益之后，就在歌曲环节开始“洗脑”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "78dbdabd73e9dd43ec267d5149799c6d0dcadaa6f934395d9d5cd405fa3a58e0", "ja": "ふぅ……お友達のみんなに会えて、\n地球のいいところいっぱい見つけちゃった♪", "zh": "呼……见到了朋友们，\n还发现了好多地球的美好之处♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f29715b9bd670f44debc1729c588d958dd5a4b06f3702100b0626c19d5b7fc4", "ja": "地球百科事典に書いておかなくちゃ！\nまた一歩、完成に近づきました！", "zh": "得记进地球百科事典才行！\n又向完成迈进了一步呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "b8626334131168b689fa4f40d8fd5ece4a3fcc99dc77cd15b1267fd0375c7cda", "ja": "みんないろいろ『せーふく』しててすごかったなぁ。\n杏奈達も頑張らないと！", "zh": "大家都穿着各种各样的『制服』，真厉害啊。杏奈也得努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "087507a74931ab92b7bc266375bee9b1663f1a067c434d48f08048b9be09427e", "ja": "みんなをもっと『せーふく』できるような、\n新しい歌、新しいダンス、新しいなにか……。", "zh": "能让大家更加被『征服』的、\n新的歌曲、新的舞蹈、新的什么东西……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "7994b8c26e7e6288fde8dbafd204be005a75b5c6523e2fd471a3db6f2893e1af", "ja": "新しい『せーふく』かぁ……。\nあっ、それなら次のコーナーはぴったりじゃないかい？", "zh": "新的“征服”啊……\n啊，那接下来的环节不是正合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "cab8e6773103012293f08834cd1398a9632727fe13766f60e3ad8239564e4c70", "ja": "えっ、なになに！？", "zh": "诶，什么什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "bbfe7d48785a30a72d22ec01947f79b6c08e52a21cc38184f38445f3570ac9a9", "ja": "次のコーナーは……スペシャルびっくり企画。\n『宇宙にお手紙』！", "zh": "接下来的环节是……特别惊喜企划。\n《寄信给宇宙》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "36996f355494b327dc1d2ec34b3cd840ed6ebac3185dc64a9ac338606a33b3bc", "ja": "今度打ち上げられるロケットに、わたし達の\nお手紙を載せることが決まったんです！", "zh": "我们写的信决定要搭乘下次发射的火箭升空了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "a4966a85a40cbb3b27b6fe45e19509dcb92efac08f7534e5fff0ffce40fa2c9e", "ja": "えっ、ロケット！？　それってえっと……つまり……\nほんもののロケットってこと！？", "zh": "诶，火箭！？　那个，呃……也就是说……\n是货真价实的火箭！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "da735a41d4b86c0f945ce8fecdb593a3e1ef9f637583c935353b9c2f7e9b8935", "ja": "もちろん！　地球をぐるぐる回る人工衛星に\n金属製のプレートをのっけるんだって。", "zh": "当然啦！听说要在绕着地球转圈的人造卫星上，放置一块金属制的铭牌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "40de7c88530b48789ceec476699287a69f88962545531f6120665877a41e8c13", "ja": "すっごーいっ！\nほんとに宇宙にいっちゃうんだ……！", "zh": "好厉害——！\n真的要去宇宙了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "5b83f91ae433f22118aa22ba4831be04b2aa485b22831fde0fbbb0cc446518c0", "ja": "その宇宙に運ばれるメッセージプレートに\nなにを刻むのかを、みんなで考えましょう！", "zh": "我们一起来想想，要在那块将被送往宇宙的留言牌上刻些什么吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "f8a8ad038b56d0b463a0bcc035c7bc6379d59c3ae415d29e4c11cf87afb424dc", "ja": "そっか。ミリオン星人以外の宇宙人が\nプレートを見てくれるかもしれないんだ！", "zh": "这样啊。说不定除了百万星人以外的外星人也会看到这块铭牌呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "b89380c4b7e7eeff71f8fdb9f56b89a280379a63310821b66041da121b1bbb2d", "ja": "もしかして、ひょっとしたら……\n地球を覗きにきてくれるかも？", "zh": "说不定、有可能……\n会来看看地球？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "2bdea01fa66430a5ae7caf79052cf821798ff2efc839bc58f1144b1144c321ef", "ja": "そしたら……ビビッ！　お友達電波受信～！\nまたお友達が増える予感だよ！", "zh": "那样的话……嗞——！接收到朋友电波～！\n感觉马上就要多一个朋友了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "2519ccabc7fea0079115fe690526699d64aad344efb3a0573d84db52d8c96900", "ja": "よーし、早速お手紙考えよう！\nみんな、何を書こうかな～？", "zh": "好～，马上来想想信的内容吧！\n各位，该写些什么好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "f20175a983db1fff761d7a230f36d0e361554a731c4271490fe375c97e8e56bb", "ja": "やっぱり遊びに来てもらうんだから。\n『地球はいいところだよ』って書かなくちゃねぇ。", "zh": "毕竟是邀请她来玩的嘛。\n当然得写上“地球是个好地方”才行呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "ba99e19db870c98d5d493bf1603e672ce3786a0236e1729c16f03d2e2e4f9d9b", "ja": "やっぱり『せんのー』『せーふく』でしょ！\nミリオン星人のモットーだもん！", "zh": "还是得写“洗脑”和“征服”吧！\n这可是百万星人的座右铭嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "70128ad4a462d97b5d89f7bb331ac84b12e195653a15178c3c06c1a339360999", "ja": "あたしは、『ともだちになろう』って書きたいなぁ。\n言葉にせねば、伝わらない気持ちもあるからねぇ。", "zh": "我想写“成为朋友”呢。\n因为有些心意，不说出来是无法传达的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "d09058314de1ef5168d487d9eb159c6e799b4e7ab4454f790d956965608574b8", "ja": "う～ん、書きたいこといっぱいありすぎて\n困っちゃいます……！　選べません。どうしよう？", "zh": "嗯～想写的东西实在太多了，真让人伤脑筋……！选不出来。怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "9a72d66ab664ff8796ba8fab48f82b0f15434747cc106c4de5c0fecdf01b4931", "ja": "だったら、全部書いちゃおうよ。\nたまきたちの思ってること、ぜ～んぶ！", "zh": "那就全都写下来吧。\n把环和大家心里想的事，全～部写下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "58a14860a6b7ea23634b0bd50b7e6aeb65b7e9185d6b6317df7f234d639a0f2d", "ja": "ん、そうだね！　今の杏奈達の、正直な気持ち……。\n全部ちゃんと伝えなくっちゃ！", "zh": "嗯，说得对！把现在杏奈她们的真实想法……全都好好传达出去才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "5b55e8ca1ae0ca99d39ed42c6c3657b8c0850f0ce056cb9f3d5a034a7a1ab065", "ja": "これでよし……っと。\nみんな、自分の気持ち全部書けたかい？", "zh": "这样就好了……好了。\n大家都把自己的心情全写下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "a057a13d38f3a6e0daf0d783238dc4b56e332c97f4f45e3c19e0c654865d22dc", "ja": "えへへ、よくばってたくさん書いちゃいましたね。\n小さな字でいっぱいです……！", "zh": "嘿嘿，不小心贪心地写了好多呢。\n上面全是密密麻麻的小字……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "b4c734afdb9c3cec722a776c84e53c6c8d8740f44107536d4f25254e7f70174d", "ja": "あとはこれがプレートに刻印されて、\n宇宙に行くのを見送るだけだね！", "zh": "接下来只要等它被刻在铭牌上，\n目送它前往宇宙就行了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "481a8bf01fd8b9a936ad2841a66538c05dd8caa65d86714981e9d64285b89ffc", "ja": "みんなで一生懸命書いたから、お返事欲しいな～。\nちゃんと見てくれるかなぁ？", "zh": "因为是大家一起努力写下的，所以真希望能收到回信啊～。\n会认真看完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2ac42f184e9322d248742834a18b67f843bbe7b0d3e522b0a96fabe4dd8c895", "ja": "わからないけど……でも、ダメでも\n何度でもお手紙をおくればいいんだよ。", "zh": "虽然不知道……但是，就算不行，\n只要不断寄信过去就好了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "ae4ee84ed5f090557f34c5ecda0483d8b5aa81f87ca2406c06c5a84436a3d5e4", "ja": "広い宇宙のみんなに、\nわたし達はここにいるよって！", "zh": "告诉广袤宇宙中的大家，\n我们就在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "c98d16ba7b5aec9cd30ec5392feded1b24390023689fa2a066dd9f0bbb7faeee", "ja": "きっと未来の地球は、\n宇宙のお友達でいっぱいだよ……！", "zh": "未来的地球上，一定会有好多来自宇宙的朋友……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "111f0fb8884b0a636db263b209b3d8516c1e969e5189eded52cf752f7f620ed6", "ja": "したっけ、未来のお友達にも届くように、\nお歌を歌うべさ！　お友達のみんな、集合～！", "zh": "那么，为了让歌声也传达到未来的朋友们那里，\n唱首歌吧！朋友们，集合啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1031_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "7d4e8a6474c40fbb5fdbd96660ca8115d5f38e1251ca2da4ce3b78674ca47609", "ja": "わーーーーっ！", "zh": "哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "83b5f4a17b29badb56a39cc82362d4bde7b32aa30d78e13be90063ae0bc06ab8", "ja": "みんなーっ、準備はいい！？", "zh": "大家——，准备好了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1033_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "c07f2c90712b326ab7d296bb95f267065dd9014e5c8f17f9ea425b889b5fe0b7", "ja": "どんなに離れていても、お友達はずっとお友達。\n宇宙のどこにいたって、繋がってる！", "zh": "无论相隔多远，朋友永远都是朋友。\n不管身在宇宙的哪个角落，我们的心都紧紧相连！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0261_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0261_story_04_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "39360352b2ceeb5df7e128cb83a2f3356395e76dbbcceb6c7f966b72b570416d", "ja": "それじゃあ、いくよーっ☆　みんなで一緒に……\n『Get lol! Get lol! SONG』！", "zh": "那么，要开始咯——☆　大家一起来……\n《Get lol! Get lol! SONG》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
